label Greeting
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	TK: Just captured some insane B-roll of the Balete tree. [pause=0.4] 
	TK: Literal gold. I think the neighborhood spirits are finally ready for their close-up. Catch you in the comments, fam!
else:
	TK: scouting out a new 'Hidden Spot' near the river. [pause=0.6] 
	TK: The lighting is peak right now. [pause=0.3] You have a good heart for keeping this base camp open. Stay peak!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
	TK: Okay, just reviewed the footage I shot out front—[pause=0.3] absolute cinema, fam!
	TK: Gonna go edit this before the lighting fades. Catch you on the next upload!
else:
	TK: Yo, hanging out by your store is low-key the best vibe in the barangay. [pause=0.3]
	TK: Alright, gotta bounce and film the outro. Stay peak!
[end_timeline]

